Paragraph count (Doc),"""The sun was shining brightly in the clear blue sky, and the birds were chirping merrily in the trees. People were out and about, going about their day, walking their dogs or enjoying a cup of coffee at the nearby cafe. It was a beautiful day, and everyone seemed to be in a good mood.

As the day went on the temperature started to rise and the sun beat down mercilessly on the pavement. People started to seek shade wherever they could find it  and the dogs lay panting in the shade of the trees. It was a reminder that even on the most beautiful days the heat could become overwhelming  and that sometimes it was necessary to take a break and cool off.""",PASS,2.0,2.0,0.0
